{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["關於大馬士革的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是關於大馬士革的預言：",{"text":"「看啊，大馬士革城必不復存在，淪為廢墟。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞羅珥的眾城邑必被廢棄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羊群將在那裡棲息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有人驚擾牠們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":"的堡壘必被摧毀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大馬士革的王權必喪失。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倖存的亞蘭人必像以色列人的榮耀一樣消失。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是萬軍之耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"「到那日，雅各的榮耀必消失，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他肥胖的身軀必漸漸消瘦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時就像人收割莊稼，收集麥穗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像人在利乏音谷拾取麥穗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倖存者寥寥無幾，就像打過的橄欖樹上剩下的果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或兩三個掛在樹梢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或四五個殘存在枝頭。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是以色列的上帝耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["到那日，人們必仰望他們的創造主，把目光轉向以色列的聖者。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["那時他們不再仰望自己雙手所造的祭壇，也不再關注自己指頭所造的亞舍拉神像和香壇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["到那日，他們因以色列人而離棄的堅城必如長滿荊棘和雜草的廢地，一片荒涼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你們忘記了拯救你們的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不記念那保護你們的磐石。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，你們雖然栽種佳美的秧子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"插上異國的樹苗，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使它們在栽種的當天早上就生長開花，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也必一無所獲。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時只有艱難和無盡的痛苦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唉！列國喧囂，如怒海洶湧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬民騷動，如洪水滔滔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然萬民喧囂如洶湧的洪水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但上帝一斥責，他們便逃往遠方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像山頂上被風捲走的糠秕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如狂風捲起的塵埃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他們晚上令人恐懼，早晨已無影無蹤。這就是擄掠我們之人的下場，搶奪我們之人的報應。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"舊約中常用以法蓮代表以色列國。","reference":{"chapter":17,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}